{{!
    @template local_coursegen/template_naming_preview

    Live preview of the section names the naming pattern would give, one line
    per section of the base course. Rendered by step_limits.js. The section
    names are escaped by the double braces, so a name holding markup is shown
    as text.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none; step_limits.js renders it into the box that carries
      data-region="local_coursegen/template/naming-preview"
      (see local_coursegen/template_naming_preview_box).

    Context variables:
    * lines array   - One entry per section.
        * text string - The section's name after applying the pattern.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lines": [
            {"text": "Unit 1: Welcome"},
            {"text": "Unit 2: Fundamentals"}
        ]
    }
}}
<small class="text-muted d-block mb-1">{{#str}} template_naming_preview, local_coursegen {{/str}}</small>
{{#lines}}
<small class="d-block">{{text}}</small>
{{/lines}}
